    {
      "audio": "docs/stories/narration/en/anbiya_musa_tabut_young_p2.m4a",
      "text": "And Allah inspired her: ﴿أَنِ ٱقۡذِفِيهِ فِي ٱلتَّابُوتِ فَٱقۡذِفِيهِ فِي ٱلۡيَمِّ﴾ — interpretation of the meaning: 'Put him in the box, then cast it into the river.' So his mother put him in a box and cast it into the river.",
